{'symbol': 'PXD', 'date': '2023-03-21 07:00:00', 'title': 'HI-CRUSH INC. ANNOUNCES AGREEMENT TO DEPLOY ITS SIXTH ONCORE IN-FIELD MINE UNIT WITH PIONEER NATURAL RESOURCES IN THE PERMIAN BASIN', 'text': 'HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HI-CRUSH INC., OR "HI-CRUSH", TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT WITH PIONEER NATURAL RESOURCES (NYSE:PXD), OR “PIONEER”, TO DEPLOY HI-CRUSH\'S SIXTH ONCORE MOBILE MINING UNIT TO SUPPLY FRAC SAND FOR USE IN PIONEER\'S WELL COMPLETIONS ACTIVITY IN THE MIDLAND BASIN.'}